{
  "display": "form",
  "name": "seededInputForm",
  "title": "Seeded input fields",
  "type": "form",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "content",
      "key": "uitleg",
      "input": false,
      "tableView": false,
      "html": "<h3>Putting zaak and taak data into editable fields</h3><p>Every field below is a normal Form.io input &mdash; a textfield, a textarea, a date picker &mdash; that Form.io has filled in from the zaak or the taak. The declaration is Form.io's own <code>customDefaultValue</code>: <code>value = zaak.identificatie</code>. No ZAC attribute or property is involved, and each field's description shows the expression that filled it.</p><p>Reading a value for <em>display</em> is done differently, with <code>&#123;&#123; zaak.identificatie &#125;&#125;</code> in a content component &mdash; see the other forms. The two are not interchangeable: an interpolated value is only rendered, while a default value becomes part of the submission and is written back as a process variable when the task completes.</p><p>The same helper functions apply, so <code>value = ZAC_formatter_datum(zaak.startdatum)</code> works. Use one only where the value is read as text: an input that parses its own value &mdash; a date picker &mdash; needs the raw value. Change a value, press <em>Save</em>, then reopen the task: Form.io leaves a default alone once the submission carries the key, so your answer is kept.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "title": "Seeded from the zaak",
      "key": "seeded_from_zaak",
      "input": false,
      "tableView": false,
      "components": [
        {
          "label": "Zaaknummer (editable)",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_zaakIdentificatie",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "customDefaultValue: \"value = zaak.identificatie\"",
          "customDefaultValue": "value = zaak.identificatie"
        },
        {
          "label": "Omschrijving",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_zaakOmschrijving",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "customDefaultValue: \"value = zaak.omschrijving\"",
          "customDefaultValue": "value = zaak.omschrijving"
        },
        {
          "label": "Startdatum as text (datum format)",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_zaakStartdatum",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "customDefaultValue: \"value = ZAC_formatter_datum(zaak.startdatum)\" — a textfield, so the formatted text is fine here",
          "customDefaultValue": "value = ZAC_formatter_datum(zaak.startdatum)"
        },
        {
          "label": "Startdatum in a date picker",
          "type": "datetime",
          "key": "IN_zaakStartdatumPicker",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "customDefaultValue: \"value = zaak.startdatum\" — a picker needs the raw ISO value and formats it itself",
          "format": "dd-MM-yyyy",
          "enableTime": false,
          "datePicker": {
            "disableWeekends": false,
            "disableWeekdays": false
          },
          "widget": {
            "type": "calendar",
            "displayInTimezone": "viewer",
            "locale": "nl",
            "useLocaleSettings": false,
            "allowInput": true,
            "mode": "single",
            "enableTime": false,
            "noCalendar": false,
            "format": "dd-MM-yyyy",
            "hourIncrement": 1,
            "minuteIncrement": 1,
            "time_24hr": true
          },
          "customDefaultValue": "value = zaak.startdatum"
        },
        {
          "label": "Opgeschort as a word",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_zaakOpgeschort",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "customDefaultValue: \"value = ZAC_formatter_jaNee(zaak.isOpgeschort)\"",
          "customDefaultValue": "value = ZAC_formatter_jaNee(zaak.isOpgeschort)"
        },
        {
          "label": "Toelichting, multi-line",
          "type": "textarea",
          "key": "IN_zaakToelichting",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "customDefaultValue: \"value = zaak.toelichting\"",
          "rows": 3,
          "customDefaultValue": "value = zaak.toelichting"
        },
        {
          "label": "Zaaktype omschrijving",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_zaakZaaktype",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "customDefaultValue: \"value = zaak.zaaktype.omschrijving\"",
          "customDefaultValue": "value = zaak.zaaktype.omschrijving"
        },
        {
          "label": "Indicaties, joined list",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_zaakIndicaties",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "customDefaultValue: \"value = zaak.indicaties\"",
          "customDefaultValue": "value = zaak.indicaties"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "title": "Seeded from the taak",
      "key": "seeded_from_taak",
      "input": false,
      "tableView": false,
      "components": [
        {
          "label": "Task name",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_taakNaam",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "customDefaultValue: \"value = taak.naam\"",
          "customDefaultValue": "value = taak.naam"
        },
        {
          "label": "Task group",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_taakGroep",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "customDefaultValue: \"value = taak.groep.naam\"",
          "customDefaultValue": "value = taak.groep.naam"
        },
        {
          "label": "Task assignee",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_taakBehandelaar",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "customDefaultValue: \"value = taak.behandelaar.naam\"",
          "customDefaultValue": "value = taak.behandelaar.naam"
        },
        {
          "label": "Deadline in a date picker",
          "type": "datetime",
          "key": "IN_taakFataledatumPicker",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "customDefaultValue: \"value = taak.fataledatum\"",
          "format": "dd-MM-yyyy",
          "enableTime": false,
          "datePicker": {
            "disableWeekends": false,
            "disableWeekdays": false
          },
          "widget": {
            "type": "calendar",
            "displayInTimezone": "viewer",
            "locale": "nl",
            "useLocaleSettings": false,
            "allowInput": true,
            "mode": "single",
            "enableTime": false,
            "noCalendar": false,
            "format": "dd-MM-yyyy",
            "hourIncrement": 1,
            "minuteIncrement": 1,
            "time_24hr": true
          },
          "customDefaultValue": "value = taak.fataledatum"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "title": "Deliberate mistakes",
      "key": "seeded_mistakes",
      "input": false,
      "tableView": false,
      "components": [
        {
          "label": "an object into an input",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_fout_object",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "customDefaultValue: \"value = zaak.zaaktype\"",
          "customDefaultValue": "value = zaak.zaaktype"
        },
        {
          "label": "a path that reads on through a value",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_fout_pad",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "customDefaultValue: \"value = zaak.identificatie.jaar\"",
          "customDefaultValue": "value = zaak.identificatie.jaar"
        },
        {
          "label": "Formatted value into a picker",
          "type": "datetime",
          "key": "IN_fout_pickerFormaat",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "customDefaultValue: \"value = ZAC_formatter_datum(zaak.startdatum)\" — the picker cannot read 24-08-2026",
          "format": "dd-MM-yyyy",
          "enableTime": false,
          "datePicker": {
            "disableWeekends": false,
            "disableWeekdays": false
          },
          "widget": {
            "type": "calendar",
            "displayInTimezone": "viewer",
            "locale": "nl",
            "useLocaleSettings": false,
            "allowInput": true,
            "mode": "single",
            "enableTime": false,
            "noCalendar": false,
            "format": "dd-MM-yyyy",
            "hourIncrement": 1,
            "minuteIncrement": 1,
            "time_24hr": true
          },
          "customDefaultValue": "value = ZAC_formatter_datum(zaak.startdatum)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "content",
      "key": "waarschuwing",
      "input": false,
      "tableView": false,
      "html": "<p><strong>Pick keys that are not process variable names.</strong> Completing a task writes every submitted key back as a process variable, so a seeded field keyed <code>zaakGroep</code> would overwrite the process variable of that name. The keys above are prefixed <code>IN_</code> for exactly that reason.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "save",
      "label": "Save",
      "type": "button",
      "theme": "secondary",
      "input": true,
      "action": "saveState",
      "state": "draft",
      "tableView": false
    },
    {
      "type": "button",
      "label": "Complete",
      "key": "submit",
      "disableOnInvalid": false,
      "input": true,
      "tableView": false
    }
  ]
}
